-Q4_0_BLOCK_BYTES    EQU     18      ; Bytes per block
-Q4_0_SCALE_BYTES    EQU     2       ; Scale is float16
-Q4_0_WEIGHT_BYTES   EQU     16      ; Packed weights
-
-; AVX-512 constants
