-;   WF_T3   = 3  : density >= 0.20 and peak < 2.5
-;   WF_Q3   = 4  : density >= 0.20 and 2.5 <= peak < 6.0
-;   WF_Q4   = 5  : density >= 0.20 and peak >= 6.0
